  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This book draws its inspiration from Ovid's classic poem Metamorphoses. Each of the ten spreads is illustrated with a character from the poem, and further meditations upon the myths are provided by poems which are slipped into the hollow inside each page. All illustrations were created by Grant Hanna in acrylic and watercolor on 190lb hot press Arches Aquarelle paper, then finished digitally in Adobe Photoshop." From colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
